 "remarks": "Location, Location, Location! Nestled in a beautiful country setting, sits Rolling Ridge Condominium's, one of Norwalk's finest places to live. Amenities that include: inground swimming pool, picturesque pond with fountains, handball/tennis court, and clubhouse with shower facilities. Located in the cul-de-sac is unit 332 featuring 1 bedroom, 1.5 bath with a den. Features include; large bedroom with remolded full bath and his and hers large double closets; a den/office or extra guest room; large living room with large widows; and kitchen with pantry leads to dining area, with sliding doors to patio terrace. Good closet space throughout, great layout and flow makes this unit and complex a place to feel like home!",
